# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent runtime workspace — PRIVATE, never commit.
# .starup/ holds session transcripts, personal memory, the runtime database,
# persona files and internal task definitions. It is local state, not source.
# Whole-directory ignore, so no new runtime file can slip in piecemeal.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.starup/
.clawhub/

# But keep example skill's dist
!skills/**/dist/

# Secrets & environment files (NEVER commit real credentials)
# .env.example is the tracked template; all real env files stay local.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
service-account*.json